Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 23:43:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] base: Stage AFME for the focused game

When a game comes to the front, apply its AFME settings from GameSpace
(gamespace_afme_multiplier, gamespace_afme_factor, gamespace_sgsr_mode,
gamespace_smooth_motion) to the persist.sys.afme.* properties the layers
read, and name it in persist.sys.afme.app so the EGL and Vulkan loaders
load the AFME layers into that game only. When it leaves, clear
persist.sys.afme.app.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QY97AsgNLyAwQpzrsxC9zt
